From ef8b6f9c2e5cdd0cf3ddbe84de7c3cd580783063 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Senior Matthew <SeniorMatt@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 02:22:09 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] kcm_bolt: Device page grammar: device rows with icon, device
 page in sections Status and Trust, buttons and hint as form rows

Page type: Device (docs/page-design.md 1). Bolt::Manager/Device, authorization and enroll/forget calls, auth modes and the kded module are unchanged.

Moved / renamed:
- Device page: the Details form is now one FormLayout (the old ColumnLayout with a FormLayout and centred buttons is gone). Order by use:
  Status, Vendor, UID, then the time that applies to the state (Authorized/Connected/Enrolled at), then section 'Trust' with Trusted: Yes/No,
  the action buttons (Authorize / Trust This Device / Revoke Trust) as a form row and the hint under them in the small font, left aligned.
  The hint has Layout.maximumWidth gridUnit*24 and the UID wraps anywhere, so the form keeps its wide layout (lesson of plasma-desktop bae85da).
  'Trust this Device' -> 'Trust This Device' (title case on buttons). Rows kcm_bolt/Trust-this-Device, Revoke-Trust, DeviceStatus, DeviceVendor,
  DeviceUid, DeviceAuthorizedAt, DeviceConnectedAt, DeviceEnrolledAt, DeviceTrusted (all carry markers). Relabel: inventory/relabel/kcm_bolt.tsv.
- Device list: each row has the Thunderbolt icon (busy indicator on top while authorizing, was a separate spinner that always took space) and a chevron.
- Markers added on the Enable switch, the three empty states and the list row (no wording change). Inventory --strict: 0 lost.
HIG ids: HIG-001/005/006, HIG-019, HIG-058.

Speed cause (code): none found; kcm_bolt.cpp only creates Bolt::Manager (async D-Bus to boltd), the QML only fills the list from the model.
The 2 s re-evaluation timers (list and device page) stay: they refresh the relative status text. After-numbers: pending, manager will measure.
Not built yet. Unconfirmed without a build: Layout.maximumWidth on a Label that is a FormLayout child, as used in plasma-desktop 56095d1; QQC2.BusyIndicator
anchored inside Kirigami.Icon.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01X5N5x9eWzmrq6QYrYLwQnk
